msgid "Redirect LAN DNS requests to port 53 (TCP and UDP, IPv4 and IPv6) to the local OxiDNS DNS listener. The target port is parsed from the OxiDNS config.yaml; implemented as an fw4 firewall redirect, so lookups made by the router itself are not affected."
